Provenance
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Forked from https://github.com/SigNoz/signoz-otel-collector

Root of this repository is SigNoz's OpenTelemetry Collector distribution,
"Initial distro implementation" (commit cc061f7, Srikanth Chekuri, SigNoz,
June 2022), original Go module path github.com/SigNoz/signoz-otel-collector.
That distribution is itself a build of the OpenTelemetry Collector.

Git history in this repository is intact (not squashed); the upstream root
commit and subsequent SigNoz history are preserved.

