COPYLEFT considerations (AGPL-3.0, Section 13)
------------------------------------------------------------------------

The repository LICENSE is AGPL-3.0, inherited from upstream SigNoz. AGPL-3.0
Section 13 ("Remote Network Interaction") requires that operators who make a
modified version available to users interacting with it over a network offer
those users access to the Corresponding Source. This collector is network
server software (OTLP :4317/:4318, ZAP-native :4319). Operation as a hosted
service therefore carries the Section 13 source-offer obligation. The
underlying OpenTelemetry Collector components remain Apache-2.0; see LICENSE
and the per-component license headers for the applicable terms of each part.

